OL,3,GNEWSAPerson taken to children's
OL,4,Ahospital after serious assault in
OL,5,ADungannon
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne person has been taken to Royal
OL,8,FBelfast Hospital for Sick Children
OL,9,Ffollowing a serious assault in County
OL,10,FTyrone.
OL,12,FPolice are currently at the scene in
OL,13,FLisnahull Road and have said the public
OL,14,Fshould avoid the area while enquiries
OL,15,Fcontinue.
OL,17,FNorthern Ireland Ambulance Service
OL,18,F(NIAS) said they received a 999 call at
OL,19,F11:08 BST on Saturday, following
OL,20,Freports of the incident.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
