OL,3,GNEWSAPerson taken to children's
OL,4,Ahospital after serious assault in
OL,5,ADungannon
OL,6,
OL,7,FThey then dispatched a helicopter crew,
OL,8,Fthree emergency crews, one advanced
OL,9,Fcare paramedic, two ambulance officers
OL,10,Fand one HART (Hazardous Area Response
OL,11,FTeam) crew to the scene.
